<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/directly-incurred-costs> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A budget category to cover all costs directly incurred because of a legitimate expenditure on a project, for example the purchase of reagents or the employment of a post-doctoral researcher."@en .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/directly-incurred-costs> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/example> "\n    :my-budget a frapo:Budget ;\n        frapo:hasBudgetInformation :my-budgeted-amout .\n    \n    :my-budgeted-amount a frapo:BudgetedAmount ;\n        frapo:hasBudgetCategory frapo:directly-incurred-costs .\n    " .
